# Generated deck artifacts — the source of truth is deck.pdf (or a
# hand-written deck.toml + images). build-deck.sh / pdf_to_deck.py
# regenerate these; deploy/CI builds them fresh, so they're not committed.
kvm2026-kansai/deck.elf
kvm2026-kansai/deck.elf.zst
kvm2026-kansai/deck.bin
kvm2026-kansai/deck_data.s
# PDF-rendered page images (slideNN.png). Hand-authored slide images
# referenced by a committed deck.toml are NOT matched by this (they'd be
# named whatever the toml says, e.g. title.png) — add them explicitly.
kvm2026-kansai/slide[0-9]*.png
